abstract: >-
  Research software artifact accompanying the paper "AcessoMap Video:
  Mapeamento Colaborativo e Sensível à Privacidade de Barreiras de
  Acessibilidade Urbana", accepted at the XXV Workshop de Ferramentas
  e Aplicações (WFA), WebMedia 2026. The artifact provides the v0.3.0
  source code and containerized environment for a mobile-first
  Progressive Web App that supports collaborative reporting of urban
  accessibility barriers through short georeferenced videos. It combines
  on-device face detection, human-reviewed spatiotemporal masks,
  keyframe-based tracking, visual redaction, approximate geolocation,
  a collaborative map, community validation, and CSV/GeoJSON exports.
  Its accompanying documentation describes the functional validation
  workflow and known limitations; quantitative anonymization accuracy
  and usability evaluations are not claimed by this release.

